Before non-trivial work, read `AGENTS.md` and follow its context lifecycle protocol.

Use `.agent/CURRENT_TASK.md` and `.agent/HANDOFF.md` before broad exploration.
Follow the relevant procedure under `.agents/skills/`.

Do not assume the current Cursor chat contains the full project state.

Do not treat files under `templates/` or the legacy `.ai/` tree as canonical V2 state.

Before modifying files, inspect existing Git working-tree changes and avoid silently overwriting work from other sessions.

After meaningful unfinished work, update canonical task/handoff state and a structured session summary so another Agent can continue without this chat.
